  a page that may not be open.

  [1m[38;5;153mapp.js[0m — [38;5;153mlogin[39m becomes [38;5;153masync[39m, returns [38;5;153m{ success, userId }[39m; the submit handler [38;5;153mawait[39ms it and calls
  [38;5;153mIdentity.set(result.userId)[39m on success only. [38;5;153mvalidateForm[39m is untouched.

  [1m[38;5;153mindex.html[0m — one added line, [38;5;153m<script src="identity.js">[39m before [38;5;153mapp.js[39m, so the global exists by the time the handler
